      "message": "I prefer make IOffloadConfig and IOffloadControl final, then you don\u0027t need to check whether they not null everywhere. We can provide getIOffloadHal getter function and change constructor to protected then allowing passing control and config to contructor so that you don\u0027t need getXXXXMockable anymore. This approach would also have advantage that you can let OffloadHardwareInterface more consistency with original one.\n\n    private final IOffloadConfig mIOffloadConfig;\n    private final IOffloadControl mIOffloadControl;\n    private final int mOffloadHalVersion;\n    protected OffloadHalHidlImpl(int version, IOffloadConfig config, IOffloadControl control, @NonNull Handler handler, @NonNull SharedLog log) {\n        mOffloadHalVersion \u003d version;\n        mIOffloadConfig \u003d config;\n        mIOffloadControl \u003d control;\n        mHandler \u003d handler;\n        mLog \u003d log.forSubComponent(TAG);\n    }\n\n     public static IOffloadHal getIOffloadHal(Handler h, SharedLog log) {\n        IOffloadConfig config \u003d null \n        try {\n            config \u003d IOffloadConfig.getService(true /*retry*/);\n        } catch (RemoteException | NoSuchElementException e) {\n            log.e(\"getIOffloadConfig error \" + e);\n            return null;\n        }\n        \n        IOffloadControl control \u003d null;\n        int version \u003d OFFLOAD_HAL_VERSION_NONE;\n        try {\n            control \u003d android.hardware.tetheroffload.control\n                   .V1_1.IOffloadControl.getService(true /*retry*/);\n            version \u003d OFFLOAD_HAL_VERSION_1_1;\n        } catch (NoSuchElementException e) {\n            // Unsupported by device.\n        } catch (RemoteException e) {\n            log.e(\"Unable to get offload control \" + OFFLOAD_HAL_VERSION_HIDL_1_0);\n        }\n        if (control \u003d\u003d null) {\n            try {\n                hal \u003d IOffloadControl.getService(true /*retry*/);\n                version \u003d OFFLOAD_HAL_VERSION_1_0;\n            } catch (NoSuchElementException e) {\n                // Unsupported by device.\n            } catch (RemoteException e) {\n                log.e(\"Unable to get offload control \" + OFFLOAD_HAL_VERSION_HIDL_1_1);\n            }\n        }\n        \n        if (config \u003d\u003d null || control \u003d\u003d null) return null;\n        \n        return new OffloadHalHidlImpl(version, config, control, h, log);\n     }",
